  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Region Infrastructure Facility - Phase Five</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRIF is a multi-agency coordination mechanism managed by the Asian Development Bank aimed at improving the delivery of development assistance from donors and development partners to the infrastructure sector in the Pacific.&#xa0;The Pacific Region Infrastructure Facility supports infrastructure development and maintenance in Pacific Island Countries through investment coordination, research and technical assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
